# Prompt placement and documentation

- Do not add comments, docstrings, or README notes that explain that attack prompts are "not web service config" or similar placement meta. Outside full architectural context this sounds confusing.
- Put prompt text only in the appropriate attack/algorithm modules; document paths briefly if needed (e.g. `vexrag/attack_algorithms/`) without contrasting with other layers unless the doc is explicitly about project layout.
